            <p>Our VPS hosting cheap system functions in the same manner as the dedicated. We would provide you have one physical server where you can run several different virtualized operating systems on that one server. It is pleasurable to say that every virtualized operating system would act as if it was a dedicated server. This endows you to have all of the advantages of a dedicated server at a fraction of the cost.
